Pearl translation contributors

The initial German catalog preserves the translations previously maintained
inline in Pearl's Zig sources. Attribution remains with the contributors
recorded in the repository history; this migration does not relicense their work.

New contributors should add their preferred attribution here and set the
Last-Translator and Language-Team headers in the PO files they maintain.
The initial migration has not received a new native-speaker review.

